text = "[center][b]Welcome to Godot Vault![/b][/center]

This project is initialized with:

[b]Core Systems:[/b]
• EventBus - Global event communication system
• GameManager - Game state management
• StateMachine - Reusable state machine implementation
• GameUtils - Collection of utility functions

[b]Directory Structure:[/b]
• [color=cyan]core/[/color] - Core reusable systems
• [color=cyan]components/[/color] - Composable game components
• [color=cyan]examples/[/color] - Demonstration scenes
• [color=cyan]addons/[/color] - Godot plugins and tools
• [color=cyan]docs/[/color] - Documentation

[b]Next Steps:[/b]
1. Explore the core systems in the [color=cyan]core/[/color] directory
2. Check out example usage patterns
3. Build your own reusable components
4. Experiment and learn!

Press [b]ESC[/b] to test EventBus communication"
fit_content = true

